# BookMate — Cursor project intelligence

## Product
- Name is **BookMate**.
- Dark-first PWA with a light theme toggle (sun/moon switch).
- Local demo works with zero env vars (SQLite). Production is **Vercel + Supabase**.
- Reading **rooms** up to **5** members; creator is **owner** (kick / delete room).

## Architecture rules
- UI reads **only** from `useSessionStore`. Never fetch Supabase from a component.
- Persistence goes through `SyncAdapter` (`local-adapter` | `supabase-adapter`).
- Page turns: optimistic Zustand → `debounceMutex` 420ms → adapter. Persist the **latest** page, not every tap.
- **Production auth:** Supabase Auth (email/password + reset emails).
- **Local demo auth:** salted SHA-256 + HMAC (`pagemate-access-token`) via `/api/auth/*` (returns 501 when Supabase env is set).
- Sign out is confirmed in a modal.
- Do not cache `/api/*` or cross-origin in `public/sw.js`.
- Push send lives in `app/api/push/send/route.ts` (Node runtime). Fans out to **room members** via service role when Supabase is configured.
- iOS Web Push requires Home Screen / standalone + **HTTPS**.

## Rooms & invites
- Primary invite: **Share this book** → `/join/{code}?book={id}` (read+write membership).
- Secondary: room invite with warning that the **whole shelf** is shared.
- Never share account passwords. No read-only role in v1.
- New rooms start with an **empty shelf** (no sample seed book).
- Schema: `reading_rooms` + `room_members` (`supabase/migrations/0002_rooms.sql`).

## Design
- Colors: canvas `#0F172A`, brand `#6366F1`, accent `#F59E0B`, cream `#F5F0E8`.
- Logo: `components/branding/BookMateLogo.tsx`.
- Fonts: Outfit + Fraunces + Vazirmatn via `next/font/local` from `app/fonts`. `adjustFontFallback: false`. Re-fetch with `node scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs`.
- Theme: `useThemeStore` + `ThemeSwitch`. Persist `pagemate-theme`. Settings → Appearance only.
- Bottom nav + `env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`. Touch targets ≥ 44px.
- Glass: `.glass` / `.glass-strong` in `app/globals.css`. Light theme on `html.light`.

## Docs
When changing debounce, RLS, SW, rooms, or push, update `docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_IMPLEMENTATION.md` and `docs/VERCEL_DEPLOY.md` as needed.
